      "content": "thanks, that's a relief. i'll do it right now. i was thinking about squeezing it a bit more aggressively after the initial prick just to make sure every last bit of the stuff inside comes out, so it doesn't just fill back up or get infected from leftovers. if i do that, would it be better to squeeze from the sides or just directly on the bump?",
